{"id":117205329886908,"name":"Nitro Tanks","desc":"🚀 Nitro Tanks – High-Speed Tank Simulator on Roblox! 💥\n\nWelcome to Nitro Tanks, an action-packed open-world tank simulator where speed breaks all the rules! Jump into powerful tanks equipped with nitro boosters, race across massive maps, launch off insane ramps, and literally fly through the air in epic stunts.\n\n🔥 Features:\n\nHuge open world to explore\nPowerful tanks with nitro acceleration\nCrazy jumps, ramps, and airborne stunts\nFun free-roam gameplay with non-stop action\nUnlock and upgrade different tanks\nPure arcade-style chaos and speed\n\nWhether you want to drift across deserts, soar over cliffs, or just boost at insane speeds—Nitro Tanks is all about freedom, speed, and destruction!\n\nStart your engine, hit the nitro, and fly like a tank has never flown before! 🏎️💨","path":"/game/117205329886908-nitro-tanks","slug":"117205329886908-nitro-tanks","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/6fcce717fa5645d611bdcbbf428639b59fad0f07c8eaa861c897e9c115714f44.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7b051968f789fbb3c1ec7abe09529dd8/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":7,"visitor":1708745,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-06T12:50:51.161Z","creator":{"name":"Electro Spartan","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Nitro-Tanks-Money-Generator-82496","_id":"695d052b0c9246429a043d74","title":"Money Generator","game":{"_id":"695d052b0c9246429a043d71","gameId":117205329886908,"name":"Nitro Tanks","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":117205329886908},"features":"Get in a tank then execute script","tags":["nitro tanks","nitro","tanks","script"],"script":"local plyr = game.Players.LocalPlayer\nlocal char = plyr.Character\nlocal humroot = char:FindFirstChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\"